WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES AND DOES NOT DO
--------------------------------------
Does: anyone who distributes this software, or runs a modified version of it as
a network service, must release their complete corresponding source under the
same licence and preserve this copyright notice. That is the strongest
copyleft obligation in common use and is what makes silent commercial
appropriation of this codebase legally untenable.

Does not: prevent anyone from reading the code, learning the method, or
independently reimplementing the ideas. Ideas, algorithms and experimental
findings are not protected by copyright in any jurisdiction. Publishing
anything publicly makes it readable; a licence governs reuse, not reading.

